  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "While Kawada rallies the team to compete through originality, a former actress Client bursts into the office holding an uncensored tape that ruined her office career. Listen for \"sozai\", raw unedited footage.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ポセイドン企画は圧倒的に制作本数を増やしてきてる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "でもうちは個性で勝負だ、個性で。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "久しぶりじゃないか。何だ、その格好は。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "さっき会社辞めてきた。これのせいで！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "私の裏ビデオ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "モザイクって取ることできるの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "薄く見せることはできても、元の素材がないと無理だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "じゃあ誰かが素材を盗んだってことですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "みんなに嫌がらせされて、会社辞めてきた。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "誰がやったんですか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "まさかマスターテープが…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "絶対に許さんぞ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ポセイドン企画は圧倒的に制作本数を増やしてきてる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Poseidon is overwhelmingly ramping up its number of productions.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "でもうちは個性で勝負だ、個性で。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Still, our studio competes through originality.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "久しぶりじゃないか。何だ、その格好は。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Long time no see! What are you all dressed up in an office suit for?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "さっき会社辞めてきた。これのせいで！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just quit my company—all because of this!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "私の裏ビデオ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'An uncensored underground video of me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "モザイクって取ることできるの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is it even possible to strip pixelation off a finished tape?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "薄く見せることはできても、元の素材がないと無理だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You can make it look faint, but removing it completely requires the original raw footage.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "じゃあ誰かが素材を盗んだってことですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait—does that mean somebody stole our master footage?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "みんなに嫌がらせされて、会社辞めてきた。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone harassed me at work, so I walked out and quit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "誰がやったんですか！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who on earth did this!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "まさかマスターテープが…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could the missing master tape really be...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "絶対に許さんぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will never forgive whoever did this.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
